se a \"multiplier\" approach: sum: 1.0 + 0.1 - 0.15 - 0.2... Wait, example: 100 + 10 (first ins) + 30 (high ench) + 50 (curse) - 20 (loyalty) - 15 (follow-up) = 155. Works.\n\nSo all modifiers are percentages of the BASE (either item base or totalBase), then summed:\n\n`total = base * (1 + sum of all modifiers)` Where each modifier is a percent.\n\nBut that doesn't work for per-item modifiers (they apply only to each item). So:\n- Per item: of (itemBase) = itemBase + itemBase * (curse% + enchant%)\n- Then sum all items = policyBase\n- Then policyBase * (1 + first_ins% + loyalty% + follow-up%)\n\nThis is the additive approach!\n\nI need to restructure. Let me rewrite the premium calculation:\n\n```\nitem_premium = base * (1 + sum of item modifiers)\npolicy_premium = sum of all item_premiums apply broker & apply policy modifiers\nfinal = Math.ceil(policy_premium * (1 + sum of policy modifiers) + PROCESSING_FEE)\n```\n\nActually wait: loyalty / first insurance / follow-up are applied to policy base premium (sum of items), and they're additive. So:\n\n```\ntotalBase = sum(item base + item surcharges)\ntotal = totalBase * (1 + loyalty_discount% + first_ins% + follow_up%)\n```\n\nWhere loyalty = -0.2 and the relevant, first= +0.1, follow-up = -0.15.\n\nSo: `total = totalBase + totalBase * (-0.2) + totalBase * 0.1 + totalBase * -0.15` if all apply. That equals totalBase * (1 - 0.2 + 0.1 - 0.15).\n\nThe alternative to this: replace current compound with additive. Let me fix the policy modifiers section.\n\nLet me completely rewrite the function with additive modifiers.\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b5db48de826644058389ea6b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-28-59_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro/src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":6138,"output":3030,"cacheRead":62208,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":71376,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784950487112,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a2993799-b7d4-48d0-8c52-d4a9455adadc","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b5db48de826644058389ea6b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"interface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: { type: string; cursed?: boolean; enchantment?: number }[];\n}\n\ninterface ClaimStep {\n  op: \"claim\";\n  policy: number;\n  incident: { cause: string; damages: { itemType: string; amount: number }[] };\n}\n\ntype ScenarioStep = QuoteStep | ClaimStep;\n\ninterface ScenarioInput {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: ScenarioStep[];\n}\n\ninterface ScenarioResult {\n  results: ({ premium: number } | { payout: number; remainingCap: number })[];\n}\n\nconst PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUMS: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n  rune: 25,\n  moonstone: 25,\n};\n\nconst COMPONENT_TYPES = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\n\nconst COMPONENT_BASE = 25;\nconst BLOCK_PRICE = 60;\n\nfunction calculateQuotePremium(\n  items: { type: string; cursed?: boolean; enchantment?: number }[],\n  customerYears: number,\n  quoteIndex: number\n): number {\n  let totalBase = 0;\n  \n  // Group components for block pricing\n  const componentCounts: Record<string, number> = {};\n  for (const item of items) {\n    if (COMPONENT_TYPES.has(item.type)) {\n      componentCounts[item.type] = (componentCounts[item.type] ?? 0) + 1;\n    } else {\n      const itemBase = BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type] ?? 0;\n      let itemTotal = itemBase;\n      // Cursed surcharge: 50% of item base premium\n      if (item.cursed) {\n        itemTotal += itemBase * 0.5;\n      }\n      // High enchantment surcharge: 30% for enchantment level ≥ 5\n      if (item.enchantment !== undefined && item.enchantment >= 5) {\n        itemTotal += itemBase * 0.3;\n      }\n      totalBase += itemTotal;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // Apply component block pricing: block of exactly 3 alike = 60 G\n  for (const count of Object.values(componentCounts)) {\n    if (count === 3) {\n      totalBase += BLOCK_PRICE;\n    } else {\n      totalBase += count * COMPONENT_BASE;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // Policy-wide loyalty discount: 20% for customers ≥ 2 years\n  if (customerYears >= 2) {\n    totalBase -= totalBase * 0.2;\n  }\n  \n  // First insurance surcharge: 10% (each item is a first insurance)\n  totalBase += totalBase * 0.1;\n  \n  // Follow-up contract discount: 15% for subsequent contracts\n  if (quoteIndex > 0) {\n    totalBase -= totalBase * 0.15;\n  }\n\n  return Math.ceil(totalBase + PROCESSING_FEE);\n}\n\nexport function processScenario(input: ScenarioInput): ScenarioResult {\n  const results: ({ premium: number } | { payout: number; remainingCap: number })[] = [];\n  let quoteIndex = 0;\n  \n  for (const step of input.steps) {\n    if (step.op === \"quote\") {\n      const premium = calculateQuotePremium(step.items, input.customer.yearsWithMHPCO, quoteIndex);\n      results.push({ premium });\n      quoteIndex++;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  return { results };\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784950502999},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I need to fix the policy modifiers to use additive percentages based on totalBase rather than compounding. Let me rewrite the policy modifier section:\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8c5ea43406664ec5a500e3c2","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"  // Policy-wide modifiers (additive, based on total base)\n  let policyMultiplier = 1.0;\n  \n  // Loyalty discount: 20% for customers ≥ 2 years\n  if (customerYears >= 2) {\n    policyMultiplier -= 0.2;\n  }\n  \n  // First insurance surcharge: 10%\n  policyMultiplier += 0.1;\n  \n  // Follow-up contract discount: 15% for subsequent contracts\n  if (quoteIndex > 0) {\n    policyMultiplier -= 0.15;\n  }\n\n  const premium = Math.ceil(totalBase * policyMultiplier + PROCESSING_FEE);","oldText":"  // Policy-wide loyalty discount: 20% for customers ≥ 2 years\n  if (customerYears >= 2) {\n    totalBase -= totalBase * 0.2;\n  }\n  \n  // First insurance surcharge: 10% (each item is a first insurance)\n  totalBase += totalBase * 0.1;\n  \n  // Follow-up contract discount: 15% for subsequent contracts\n  if (quoteIndex > 0) {\n    totalBase -= totalBase * 0.15;\n  }\n\n  return Math.ceil(totalBase + PROCESSING_FEE);"}],"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-28-59_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro/src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1003,"output":447,"cacheRead":71168,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":72618,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784950503003,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-217ac573-816c-4ad9-82ee-5d0367a722c8","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8c5ea43406664ec5a500e3c2","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-28-59_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro/src/claim-office.ts."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  71       totalBase += count * COMPONENT_BASE;\n  72     }\n  73   }\n  74   \n- 75   // Policy-wide loyalty discount: 20% for customers ≥ 2 years\n+ 75   // Policy-wide modifiers (additive, based on total base)\n+ 76   let policyMultiplier = 1.0;\n+ 77   \n+ 78   // Loyalty discount: 20% for customers ≥ 2 years\n  76   if (customerYears >= 2) {\n- 77     totalBase -= totalBase * 0.2;\n+ 80     policyMultiplier -= 0.2;\n  78   }\n  79   \n- 80   // First insurance surcharge: 10% (each item is a first insurance)\n- 81   totalBase += totalBase * 0.1;\n+ 83   // First insu